[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0010","text":"啊，有小猫！\n而且还是两只！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0020","text":"它们朝同一个方向走……！\n可以跟上去看看吗，千子前辈！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0030","text":"哇……！\n这里好多小猫啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0040","text":"这就是所谓的猫咪集会吧……？\n呵呵，它们在聊些什么呢……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0050","text":"那这样的话……！\n我来当调查队！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0060","text":"不要惊动它们哦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0070","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0080","text":"！\n潜入，成功了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0090","text":"那么，就那样保持安静，\n好好观察小猫们……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_02_0100","text":"嘿嘿，收到……！"}]
